  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-remote-exec",
      "text": "**Run DeepSeek Harness locally, execute on your server.** One plugin; the\nagent's file tools and shell operate on a remote machine over SSH or mosh.\n\n```yaml\n- id: remote-exec\n  name: '@morewax/dsh-remote-exec'\n  config:\n    driver: ssh          # ssh | mosh"
    },
    {
      "section": "Drivers",
      "text": "| Driver | Exec & files | Interactive terminal | Auth |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `ssh` | OpenSSH | ssh PTY | keys, or `tailscale: true` for keyless tailnet identity |\n| `mosh` | via ssh | **native mosh** — roaming-safe, survives sleep | same as ssh |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile default add github:moreWax/dsh-remote-exec\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Development",
      "text": "```sh\npnpm install\npnpm run typecheck\npnpm test          # offline suites\npnpm build"
    },
    {
      "section": "live end-to-end over ssh (needs key auth to the target):",
      "text": "DSH_REMOTE_LIVE=1 DSH_REMOTE_HOST=127.0.0.1 DSH_REMOTE_USER=$USER \\\nDSH_REMOTE_ROOT=/tmp/remote-test pnpm test\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Status",
      "text": "Built against DeepSeek Harness `0.1.1-rc.x` (developer preview). Remote shell\nand filesystem are verified end-to-end over SSH; mosh interactive uses the\nstandard `mosh` client behavior."
    }
  ],
